---@field securityProfile? azure.containerservice.AgentPoolSecurityProfile The security settings of an agent pool.
---@field gpuProfile? azure.containerservice.GPUProfile GPU settings for the Agent Pool.
---@field gatewayProfile? azure.containerservice.AgentPoolGatewayProfile Profile specific to a managed agent pool in Gateway mode. This field cannot be set if agent pool mode is not Gateway.
