---@field virtualMachineNodesStatus? azure.containerservice.ManagedClusterAgentPoolProfileInputVirtualMachineNodesStatusList The status of nodes in a VirtualMachines agent pool.
---@field status? azure.containerservice.AgentPoolStatusInput Contains read-only information about the Agent Pool.
---@field localDNSProfile? azure.containerservice.LocalDNSProfile Configures the per-node local DNS, with VnetDNS and KubeDNS overrides. LocalDNS helps improve performance and reliability of DNS resolution in an AKS cluster. For more details see aka.ms/aks/localdns.
